      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(u=9.8,\\ \\alpha=30^\\circ\\):\ni: \\(H=\\dfrac{u^2\\sin^2\\alpha}{2g}=\\dfrac{96.04\\times0.25}{19.6}=1.225\\approx1.22\\) m, সত্য।\nii: \\(T=\\dfrac{2u\\sin\\alpha}g=\\dfrac{2\\times9.8\\times0.5}{9.8}=1\\) s, সত্য।\niii: \\(R=\\dfrac{u^2\\sin2\\alpha}g=9.8\\times\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}2=4.9\\sqrt3\\) m, সত্য।",
