          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "i: \\(0=u^2-2gH\\) ⇒ \\(H=\\dfrac{u^2}{2g}\\), সত্য।\nii: ভূমিতে ফিরে আসার সময় \\(\\dfrac{2u}g\\) (\\(\\dfrac ug\\) নয়), মিথ্যা।\niii: \\(h=ut-\\dfrac12gt^2\\) সমাধান করে \\(t=\\dfrac{u\\pm\\sqrt{u^2-2gh}}g\\), সত্য।",
      "source": {
        "board": "DIB",
